# PageScript Documentation Site

::page id=pagescript-docs title="PageScript Documentation"
  ::tokens
    color.bg="#f7f7f2"
    color.ink="#202124"
    color.accent="#116149"
    color.panel="#ffffff"
    color.line="#deded4"
    radius.panel=14
  ::/tokens

  ::style scope=page
    .docs-hero { background: radial-gradient(circle at 18% 18%, rgba(77,214,160,.22), transparent 30%), linear-gradient(135deg, #f7f7f2, #e7f1ea); }
    .docs-card { min-height: 180px; }
    .docs-card .ps-icon { color: var(--ps-accent); font-weight: 800; }
  ::/style

  ::hero class=docs-hero spacing=xl
    heading="PageScript"
    body="1,787 authored tokens become a 4,975-token standalone page: 64.08% fewer tokens in the PageScript source under o200k_base. The compiler also turns reviewed evidence bundles into deterministic, source-cited HTML."
  ::/hero

  ::section spacing=lg
    heading="Start here"
    body="The docs homepage is itself authored in PageScript and rendered by the GitHub Pages workflow."

    ::grid columns=4 gap=md density=compact
      ::card class=docs-card icon="01" title="Specification"
        body="Draft 0.7 language model, compiler pipeline, safety rules, recipes, and source-cited explainer direction. See SPEC.md."
      ::/card

      ::card class=docs-card icon="02" title="Conformance"
        body="Parser, validator, IR, renderer, token benchmark fixture, schemas, and compatibility expectations. See CONFORMANCE.md."
      ::/card

      ::card class=docs-card icon="03" title="Generation Guide"
        body="Compact syntax guide, small examples, compiler repair loop, and audit question for generated .page files. See docs/generation-guide.md."
      ::/card

      ::card class=docs-card icon="04" title="Extension Model"
        body="Deterministic core, recipe iteration, Web Core Kernel reach, and explicit non-standard escape boundaries. See docs/extension-model.md."
      ::/card
    ::/grid
  ::/section

  ::scene id=compiler-pipeline layout=split title="Compiler pipeline"
    heading="The standard is source-first, not renderer-first"
    body="Code generators write semantic composition. PageScript validates it, normalizes it into IR, and renders target output without source-authored JavaScript."

    ::panel id=pipeline-steps title="Pipeline stages" density=spacious
      ::stack gap=md
        ::card icon="A" title=".page source"
          body="Compact source optimized for generation and human review."
        ::/card
        ::card icon="B" title="PageScript IR"
          body="Normalized machine-readable representation for renderers and conformance tests."
        ::/card
        ::card icon="C" title="Standalone HTML"
          body="HTML, CSS, SVG, and the fixed declarative runtime emitted by the compiler."
        ::/card
      ::/stack
    ::/panel

    ::panel id=release-checks title="Release gates" tone=muted density=compact
      ::metric id=tests label="Conformance tests" value="34" tone=good
      ::/metric
      ::metric id=stdlib label="Standard Library" value="4 recipe packs" tone=accent
      ::/metric
      ::metric id=workflow label="Docs build" value="source -> verified HTML" tone=good
      ::/metric
    ::/panel
  ::/scene

  ::section spacing=lg
    heading="Measured source reduction"
    body="The revenue-map fixture uses 1,787 o200k_base tokens as LF-normalized authored PageScript source and 4,975 tokens as generated standalone HTML: 64.08% fewer tokens in the authored artifact. The checked-in benchmark measures those two artifacts only; it excludes prompts, tool calls, repair turns, and prior context."

    ::grid columns=3 gap=md density=compact
      ::metric id=source-tokens label="PageScript source" value="1,787 tokens" tone=good
      ::/metric
      ::metric id=html-tokens label="Standalone HTML" value="4,975 tokens" tone=accent
      ::/metric
      ::metric id=token-reduction label="Authored reduction" value="64.08%" tone=good
      ::/metric
    ::/grid
  ::/section
::/page
